Kernel payload snapshot for the 7.3 line (oneplus-erhai-linux-7.3 + package
metadata).  Committed: DEBIAN/, boot/ and the folder structure.  NOT committed:
usr/lib/modules/** -- the compiled module tree (see ../../.gitignore); it is
reproduced by the kernel build (build-kernel.sh / repack-kernel-deb.sh) and only
the packaged .deb needs it.
